{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22045","headline":"新乐府 二王後\t明祖宗之意也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 二王後\t明祖宗之意也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二王後，彼何人，介公酅公爲国宾。\n周武隋文之子孙，古人有言天下者，非是一人之天下。\n周亡天下传於隋，隋人失之唐得之。\n唐兴十叶岁二百，介公酅公世爲客。\n明堂太庙朝享时，引居宾位备威仪。\n备威仪，助郊祭，高祖太宗之遗制。\n不独兴灭国，不独继绝世。\n欲令嗣位守文君，亡国之孙取爲戒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}